`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Claude can handle messy spreadsheets, incomplete datasets, and varied formats. Providing the actual source data allows Claude to spot trends, calculate metrics, and create visualizations you might not have considered. If you have 500 rows of participant outcomes, upload all 500—Claude can find patterns across the complete dataset that wouldn't be visible in samples."}),`
